 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "你在一个去中心化交易所，用 10 个 ETH 换 USDC。",
   "spoken": "你在一个去中心化交易所，用 10 个 ETH 换 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.293
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "池子现价，1 个 ETH 换 2000 USDC。这是示例。",
   "spoken": "池子现价，1 个 ETH 换 2000 USDC。这是示例。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.356,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 6.454,
   "speechEnd": 11.118
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "你把滑点设成 5%。",
   "spoken": "你把滑点设成 5%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.192,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 12.29,
   "speechEnd": 14.004
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "意思是，最少拿到 19000 USDC。少于这个数，交易就回滚。",
   "spoken": "意思是，最少拿到 19000 USDC。少于这个数，交易就回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.052,
   "dur": 6.984,
   "speechStart": 15.15,
   "speechEnd": 21.207
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "交易发出去，先进入公开的内存池，排队等着打包。",
   "spoken": "交易发出去，先进入公开的内存池，排队等着打包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.256,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 22.354,
   "speechEnd": 26.437
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "有人在打包之前，读到了它。",
   "spoken": "有人在打包之前，读到了它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.492,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 27.59,
   "speechEnd": 29.792
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "他把你的交易，夹在自己的两笔交易中间。",
   "spoken": "他把你的交易，夹在自己的两笔交易中间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.832,
   "dur": 3.792,
   "speechStart": 30.93,
   "speechEnd": 33.775
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 34.844,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 34.942,
   "speechEnd": 36.096
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "你最少收到多少？他能让你收到更少吗？",
   "spoken": "你最少收到多少？他能让你收到更少吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 37.152,
   "dur": 4.104,
   "speechStart": 37.25,
   "speechEnd": 40.414
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "你最少收到 19000。他不能让你更少。",
   "spoken": "你最少收到 19000。他不能让你更少。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 41.756,
   "dur": 4.2,
   "speechStart": 41.854,
   "speechEnd": 45.113
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "低于这个数，你的交易回滚，他也赚不到钱。",
   "spoken": "低于这个数，你的交易回滚，他也赚不到钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-10.mp3",
   "start": 46.176,
   "dur": 4.848,
   "speechStart": 46.274,
   "speechEnd": 50.178
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "所以，他会把价格推到刚好够 19000 的位置。",
   "spoken": "所以，他会把价格推到刚好够 19000 的位置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-11.mp3",
   "start": 51.244,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 51.342,
   "speechEnd": 54.937
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "你的交易没有失败。它只是按你允许的最差价格，成交了。",
   "spoken": "你的交易没有失败。它只是按你允许的最差价格，成交了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-12.mp3",
   "start": 56.0,
   "dur": 5.664,
   "speechStart": 56.098,
   "speechEnd": 60.821
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-13",
   "text": "滑点设 5%，就可能真的付 5%。",
   "spoken": "滑点设 5%，就可能真的付 5%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-13.mp3",
   "start": 61.884,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 61.982,
   "speechEnd": 65.053
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-14",
   "text": "交易在打包之前是公开的，顺序由别人决定。",
   "spoken": "交易在打包之前是公开的，顺序由别人决定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-14.mp3",
   "start": 66.112,
   "dur": 4.224,
   "speechStart": 66.21,
   "speechEnd": 69.483
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-15",
   "text": "签名在用过之后仍然存在。能不能再用，取决于你签了什么。",
   "spoken": "签名在用过之后仍然存在。能不能再用，取决于你签了什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-15.mp3",
